    <description>Who are the top 25 individual donors based on Total Giving (includes both direct gifts and soft credits)? A list of Donor Gift Summaries related to &apos;Person&apos; Accounts, ranked by Total Hard and Soft Credits Amount descending, and limited to 25 records.</description>
